{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1534492-question-on-creating-an-unaffiliated-sidhe","id":1534492,"title":"Question on creating an unaffiliated Sidhe","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Changeling: The Dreaming"],"posts":[{"date":"2024-04-20T09:03:19-07:00","id":1534492,"title":"Question on creating an unaffiliated Sidhe","content":"I am quite a new player in CTD and I have a question. Our Story Teller told us that our game would be set in Eastern Europe (predominantly Russia, Ukraine and Belarus), and as I understood, there is a House Varich here. I like Slavic mythology, but should I pick House Varich as a sidhe? From what I've read, I got that it's not necessary to belong to any House, so can I be unaffiliated Sidhe or I am mistaken? Would it contradict lore if there would be a Slavic Sidhe that is not from this House Varich?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28215-madislak","name":"Madislak","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-20T12:16:46-07:00","id":1534503,"title":"","content":"Sure, you can do that. You might need to explain how you came to be there but, for example, if you have a point or two in Remembrance you'll remember some details of who you were before you were born in a human body which can include your house. Or alternatively maybe your chrysalis came unusually late and you lived a human life long enough to move halfway around the world.<br /> <br /> The main thing about Varich will be that if you're not one of them then they outnumber you and you'll always be an outsider.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13395-daniel-knight","name":"Daniel Knight","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"96"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-20T12:58:44-07:00","id":1534504,"title":"","content":"Why not create a new House? All of the existing Sidhe houses are &quot;Houses of the Moon.&quot; Why not a House of the Sun or the Stars?<br /> <br /> A House Belobog could be a house of pure heroes, if somewhat naive.<br /> <br /> Where House Belobog would be a House of the Sun look at Gaiman's <b>American Gods</b> Belobog's sisters are star deities, they'd inspire some lively houses.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":857,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","user":"Astromancer","date":". 04-20-2024, 04:01 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-20T13:00:34-07:00","id":1534505,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Daniel Knight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1534492-question-on-creating-an-unaffiliated-sidhe?p=1534503#post1534503\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> You might need to explain how you came to be there</div> </div> </div> </div>Thank you for your reply! One more question, as a kith, like Boggan, Satyr or Redcap, can a local changeling not be alligned with House Varich and still be of local origin? Or for them rules are the same as for Sidhe?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":28215,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28215-madislak","user":"Madislak","date":". 04-20-2024, 04:47 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28215-madislak","name":"Madislak","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-20T13:03:08-07:00","id":1534506,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Astromancer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1534492-question-on-creating-an-unaffiliated-sidhe?p=1534504#post1534504\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Why not create a new House?</div> </div> </div> </div>I kinda afraid I would ruin the game as a novice if I do that, but thank you for some information and your reply!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28215-madislak","name":"Madislak","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-20T14:36:52-07:00","id":1534509,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Madislak</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1534492-question-on-creating-an-unaffiliated-sidhe?p=1534506#post1534506\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I kinda afraid I would ruin the game as a novice if I do that, but thank you for some information and your reply!</div> </div> </div> </div>Nonsense. Your game is your game. If you need more Slavic houses create what you need. The house gifts and bans for the other houses with be a solid guideline. <br /> <br /> You're having fun with your friends not engaging in tournament play for cash. Have fun and be creative.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-20T16:43:57-07:00","id":1534512,"title":"","content":"Sounds fair, thank you!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28215-madislak","name":"Madislak","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-22T13:31:19-07:00","id":1534565,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Madislak</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1534492-question-on-creating-an-unaffiliated-sidhe?p=1534505#post1534505\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Thank you for your reply! One more question, as a kith, like Boggan, Satyr or Redcap, can a local changeling not be alligned with House Varich and still be of local origin? Or for them rules are the same as for Sidhe?</div> </div> </div> </div>Sure. Why would a noble house care whether the Boggan tailor across town is affiliated with them or not? If the lord's cloak needs patching up then as a changeling he's less likely to mess up the chimerical decorations than a human tailor but in the end he's just a tailor.<br /> <br /> Now a Sicilian noble house might look at things differently, of course.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13395-daniel-knight","name":"Daniel Knight","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"96"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-04-28T22:23:53-07:00","id":1534885,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Madislak</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1534492-question-on-creating-an-unaffiliated-sidhe?p=1534505#post1534505\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Thank you for your reply! One more question, as a kith, like Boggan, Satyr or Redcap, can a local changeling not be alligned with House Varich and still be of local origin? Or for them rules are the same as for Sidhe?</div> </div> </div> </div>Non Sidhe can absolutely be commoners with no afilliation whatsoever, even inside of Mother Russia.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28035-magus-maximus","name":"Magus Maximus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"569"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}